    "rules": "Record \"pandemic\". Each side chooses: Close the borders? If LIO says yes, LIO spends 1 point on actions, then until the end of this turn, each time LIO spends points, it spends 1 fewer, never below 1; otherwise, (draw from the Contingency deck of the side that played this card, then if the result is 3 or more, LIO spends 2 points on one action, then SAE spends 1 point on actions; otherwise, SAE spends 1 point on actions). If SAE says yes, SAE spends 1 point on actions, then until the end of this turn, each time SAE spends points, it spends 1 fewer, never below 1; otherwise, (draw from the Contingency deck of the side that played this card, then if the result is 3 or more, SAE spends 2 points on one action, then LIO spends 1 point on actions; otherwise, LIO spends 1 point on actions).",
